			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FB9EA4152DCD1D3"]
			description: [
				"A new Overworld vein of fluorite, barite, galena and sphalerite grows only in freshly generated chunks. Time to go somewhere you've never been."
