		{
			dependencies: ["30D78F6EB49AF27B", "5EE3EB2547415591", "5FD0B9548159D199"]
			description: ["Circuit 1 turns uraninite and hydrofluoric acid into &6Uranium 235&r and a pile of uranium 238. Keep the 238: pellets, radon and later MOX all want it."]
