		{
			dependencies: ["3513B00E50D7C58B"]
			description: ["Heavy water slows neutrons without eating them, and on circuit 2 the same assembly gives twice the power. It comes out as &6Tritiated Heavy Water&r, and the reactor never vents it. Give it a tank."]
